    "text": "{\"resource\":\"filing_items\",\"ticker\":\"INTU\",\"cik\":\"0000896878\",\"filing_type\":\"8-K\",\"accession_number\":\"0000896878-26-000043\",\"filing_url\":\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/896878/000089687826000043/0000896878-26-000043-index.html\",\"items\":[{\"number\":\"Item 2.02\",\"name\":\"Results of Operations and Financial Condition\",\"text\":\"On November 19, 2026, Intuit announced its financial results for the fiscal quarter ended October 31, 2026 and provided forward-looking guidance. A copy of the press release is attached to this Report as Exhibit 99.01. The information in this Item 2.02 and Exhibit 99.01 attached hereto shall not be deemed “filed” for purposes of Section 18 of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended (the “Exchange Act”), nor shall they be deemed incorporated by reference in any filing under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the \\\"Securities Act\\\"), or the Exchange Act, except as shall be expressly stated by specific reference in such filing.\"},{\"number\":\"Item 8.01\",\"name\":\"Other Events\",\"text\":\"On November 19, 2026, Intuit also announced that the Board approved a cash dividend of $1.38 per share. The cash dividend will be paid on January 15, 2027 to shareholders of record as of the close of business on January 8, 2027. Future declarations of dividends and the establishment of future record dates and payment dates are subject to the final determination of the Board. A copy of the press release announcing the cash dividend is furnished as Exhibit 99.01 to this Report.\"},{\"number\":\"Item 9.01\",\"name\":\"Financial Statements and Exhibits\",\"text\":\"(d) Exhibits 99.01 Press release issued on November 19, 2026 reporting financial results for the quarter ended October 31, 2026 and announcing the cash dividend. * 104 Cover Page Interactive Data File (the cover page XBRL tags are embedded within the inline XBRL document) * This exhibit is intended to be furnished and shall not be deemed “filed” for purposes of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended. SIGNATURES Pursuant to the requirements of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, the Registrant has duly caused this report to be signed on its behalf by the undersigned hereunto duly authorized. Date: November 19, 2026 INTUIT INC. By: /s/ Sandeep S. Aujla Sandeep S. Aujla Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer\"}]}"
